---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
---
<ContentPage
  title="What's New"
  description="Release notes and product updates for TrueSVG."
  path="/changelog/"
  eyebrow="RELEASE NOTES"
>
  <section class="release" aria-labelledby="version-1-3-0">
    <p class="release-label"><time datetime="2026-09-16">September 16, 2026</time></p>
    <h2 id="version-1-3-0">Version 1.3.0</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Support for the iOS 27 interface.</li>
      <li>Drag and drop PNG, JPG, or WEBP images directly into TrueSVG on iPad and Mac to start converting.</li>
      <li>Added support for Catalan, Czech, Greek, Finnish, Hebrew, Hindi, Croatian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Malay, Polish, Portuguese (Portugal), Romanian, Slovak, Thai, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, and regional English, Spanish, and French variants.</li>
      <li>Bug fixes and improvements.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="release" aria-labelledby="version-1-2-0">
    <p class="release-label"><time datetime="2025-12-27">December 27, 2025</time></p>
    <h2 id="version-1-2-0">Version 1.2.0</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Share compressed ZIP files by email using the Mail action in the Share Sheet.</li>
      <li>Added Korean and Turkish language support.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="release" aria-labelledby="version-1-1-1">
    <p class="release-label"><time datetime="2025-12-20">December 20, 2025</time></p>
    <h2 id="version-1-1-1">Version 1.1.1</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>New iOS 26 interface.</li>
      <li>Enhancements and improvements.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="release" aria-labelledby="version-1-1-0">
    <p class="release-label"><time datetime="2025-11-15">November 15, 2025</time></p>
    <h2 id="version-1-1-0">Version 1.1.0</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>New iOS 26 interface.</li>
      <li>Enhancements and improvements.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="release" aria-labelledby="version-1-0-1">
    <p class="release-label"><time datetime="2025-09-16">September 16, 2025</time></p>
    <h2 id="version-1-0-1">Version 1.0.1</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Enhancements and improvements.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="release" aria-labelledby="version-1-0-0">
    <p class="release-label">Initial release</p>
    <h2 id="version-1-0-0">Version 1.0.0</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Convert PNG, JPG, and WEBP images into SVG while preserving visual fidelity and design intent.</li>
      <li>Create optimized vector paths for logos, icons, illustrations, and scalable graphics.</li>
      <li>Export files that work with Adobe Illustrator, Figma, Sketch, and other SVG-compatible design tools.</li>
      <li>Generate clean, editable vector curves while reducing unnecessary file complexity.</li>
      <li>Keep converted graphics crisp at every resolution, from interface icons to large-format print.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</ContentPage>
